  "description": "Renders one shot from your prompt and seven choices written as sentences: the movement, the camera, the lens, the focus, the light, the color and the mood. LTX 2.5 runs it in two stages and makes its sound. A run with sound off drops the audio track. Built from Comfy's template video_ltx2_5_t2v.",
